        "patch": "diff --git a/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/full_description.txt b/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/full_description.txt\nindex 50e46c3..9878b95 100644\n--- a/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/full_description.txt\n+++ b/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/full_description.txt\n@@ -1 +1 @@\n-Built entirely in native Kotlin, runs fully on-device, avoids tracking, and keeps distractions to a minimum by emphasizing clarity and intentional interaction.\n\\ No newline at end of file\n+Built entirely in native Kotlin, Txori runs fully on-device, avoids tracking, no internet access, and no external APIs.\n\\ No newline at end of file\n"
